{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/extras/Banner01.png?t=1741818820\" /><strong>Welcome to the Station</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A catastrophic explosion has left the station in ruins, its AI cores scattered and its secrets buried. Your mission? Extract the cores and uncover the truth\u2014before the station shuts down for good.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/extras/Banner02.png?t=1741818820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical Top-Down Combat\u2026 Until Everything Changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with an array of customizable weapons, you'll navigate the station, fend off infected machines, and adapt to its unpredictable dangers. But be warned\u2014this is no ordinary mission. When the station goes offline, everything shifts.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/extras/Banner03.png?t=1741818820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Surprising Twist: First-Person Survival Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suddenly, the rules change. The once-distant threats become up-close nightmares as you're thrown into intense <strong>first-person combat</strong>. Your reflexes, accuracy, and resourcefulness will be pushed to the limit. Can you survive when the station turns against you?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/extras/Banner04.png?t=1741818820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro Vibes with a Modern Edge</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Shader for a gritty, retro aesthetic</strong> \u2013 toggle it on or off anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize Your Arsenal</strong> \u2013 adapt your weapons to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guided by Prize</strong> \u2013 your operator watches through security cameras, offering insight\u2026 and warnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Station Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 each AI core brings you closer to the truth, but some knowledge comes at a cost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;You never know what might happen when you dig too deep.&quot;<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/extras/Banner05.png?t=1741818820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are You Ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the station. Adapt, survive, and prepare for the unexpected.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Stone Unturned ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295150/47f9703d70064dc2bbc242ac12bba0ff4ab3bd88.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295150/cc4e6218203f89a3a8bc2e68671a2c47f3d73698.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295150/9c9eec666a926442ce8d467145ecee3961b8b561.jpg"},{"name":"Your first day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295150/f632eb5dfa8c5cf850268bc3798a32563eff7813.jpg"},{"name":"Breach of contract ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295150/0db968a17b84a70a52e729c8f1f1089e8b9f76dc.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295150?t=1741818820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741818820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295150/24964859b9760ff4a25ac05134c77ef9630376f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741818820","capsule_imagev